                                                "sense_id": "bfe118ad-ac9c-3edc-9536-75d9058bfdf1",
                                                "text": "People had to poo in bags, you see. Jan had to get on the public address system and explain to thousands of disbelieving passengers that “number ones” could be done in the shower but “number twos” must be done in the red biohazard bags being distributed, then placed in corridors for collection by unnamed staff, none of whom chose to appear in this documentary."
                                            }
